module

public import Theory.Representation.MathieuCodeRestriction.CocodeLocal.Octad.Involutions.Transport

/-!
# Native cocode involution calculations

The certified native representatives `Involutions.z` and `Involutions.t`
have order two, respectively an octad and an empty point fixed set, and
cocode fixed codimensions four and five. The pointwise centralizer of the
first fixed space is its cyclic subgroup. The transport module exports
these conclusions for native conjugates and for the actual M23 restriction.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith H.14.4(3) and H.15.2(5), printed pp.397–399.
-/
